  "description": "Tacoma Electric Fat Tire Bike – Adventure Awaits with Power, Comfort & Speed\nGet into the adventure spirit with this Tacoma electric fat tire bike. Powered with a long-lasting battery, this electric bike is perfect for cruising around and have fun. The ergonomic speed, coupled with bright headlight, a stunning display panel and good brake grip make this bike the most fantastic ride ever. Switch between 7 speed powerful modes and enjoy a swift ride.\n\nSIZES\n\n26\"\n\nFRAME\n\nAluminum Alloy Hidden battery design Control Freak internal routing\n\nFORK\n\nAlloy Suspension, Lockout and Preload Adjustment\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Alloy 680x31.8mm\n\nSTEM\n\nAlloy 1 1/8\" Chunk Threadless\n\nHEADSET\n\nAlloy 28.6x31.8x90mm Heavy Duty\n\nSEATPOST\n\nSteel Diameter 28.6x44x30H2mm\n\nSADDLE\n\nExtra padding and wide shell for maximum comfort\n\nPEDALS\n\nOne-piece PP\n\nSHIFTERS\n\nShimano Finger controller Plus 7-Speed\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\nShimano Tx300 7-Speed\n\nBRAKE\n\nDisc F-160mm, R-160mm\n\nBRAKE LEVERS\n\nAlloy\n\nCASSETTE\n\nShimano TZ500 14-28T 7-Speed\n\nCHAIN\n\nKMC Z7 1/2x3/32x118L\n\nCRANKSET\n\nAlloy/Steel 38T 170mm\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nCartridge Steel Speed Sensors\n\nRIMS\n\nFAT Alloy Wide 80mm 26” *36H*13G Spoke wheelset\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nAlloy 3/8”x13Gx36H 135x175mm\n\nREAR HUB MOTOR\n\nAlloy 3/8”x13Gx36Hx170mm 48V 800W\n\nSENSOR\n\nTorque + Speed Sensor\n\nBATTERY\n\nPanasonic Lithium Battery 48V/12.8Ah\n\nCHARGING TIME\n\n4-6 Hours\n\nMAX SPEED\n\n22 Mile\n\nTRAVEL RANGE\n\nPure electric 30-55 Mile\n\nDISPLAY\n\nLCD\n\nSPOKES\n\n13gauge steel\n\nTIRES\n\nBlack fat tire, 26x4.0\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThis Lithium Battery 26 Inch Electric Chopper Stretch E-Bike Fat Tires is powered by 48V/12.8Ah Li-ion battery which can be charged in 4-6 hours. Equipped with 800W light weight high speed brushless rear wheel hub motor (EU), it can achieve a maximum speed of 20mile/h with a travel range of 25-30mile. It has an intelligent Pedals Assisted System which makes it like a normal bike and provides a natural riding experience.",
